behavioural edits (M15)
V1 in 0 2
R1 in vx 1k
R2 vx 0 2k
Vs vx vs 0 ; sense
R3 vs 0 1k
.param k=2
B1 bo 0 V=k*V(vs) ic=0 ; bare
R4 bo 0 1k
B2 bi 0 I={1m*V(vx)} Rpar=10Meg
R5 bi 0 1k
B3 br bo R = 1k +
+ V(vx)
E1 eo 0 value={V(vx)+1}
R7 eo 0 1k
F1 0 fo value={2*I(Vs)}
R8 fo 0 1k
C1 vx 0 Q=1n*x
L1 vx ln Flux=1m*tanh(5*x)
R9 ln 0 1k
.op
.end
